      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After previous experience with this company, and positive word of mouth recommendations from other customers , I had no hesitation to select G and A Martin to install a 6.3kW solar system at my premises .The original site visit by Joanie to quote the job was impressive as she had already done research for my power supply at my address, and she could offer constructive advice re the solar installation.After accepting the quote, I was kept informed of the \"behind the scenes\" progress and a definite installation date.The installation team completed the installation in one day, they displayed professionalism, co-operation and respect for my property. The site was left in a clean state, with all rubbish and packing removed. Any questions I had re the installation were satisfactorily answered. Shortly after, I received all the documentation including particulars of equipment installed, validation and compliance certificates and owners manual.It was a pleasure to do business with this company, and I would not hesitate to recommend G&A Martin.Allan",
